******************************** Data Format ***********************************

Column 01: Month
Column 02: Hour
Column 03: Frequency (MHz)
Column 04: D - Path distance (km)
Column 05: BMUF - Path basic MUF (MHz)
Column 06: E - Path Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
Column 07: SNR - Median signal-to-noise ratio (dB)
Column 08: Free-space Field Strength 3 MW e.i.r.p. (dB(1uV/m)
Column 09: Increased Long Distance Field Strength due to Focusing (dB)
Column 10: "Not otherwise included loss" (dB)
Column 11: Upper Reference Frequency (MHz)
Column 12: Lower Reference Frequency (MHz)
Column 13: Correction Factor at T + d0/2
Column 14: Correction Factor at R - d0/2
Column 15: Max Antenna Gain G_tl (0 - 8 deg)
Column 16: Max Antenna Gain G_rw (0 - 8 deg)
Column 17: Mean gyrofrequency
Column 18: Scale factor f(f ,fL, fM, fH)

************************** End Data Format ********************************

